  "title": "Adtran and GLDS expand partnership to deliver billing-driven, zero-touch automation for subscriber lifecycle management",
  "summary": "Adtran today announced a new phase in its long-standing partnership with GLDS, delivering billing-driven, zero-touch automation for subscriber lifecycle management. As broadband and managed Wi-Fi services scale, manual hand-offs between billing, OSS and in-home networking systems are no longer sustainable.",
